---
import LocationLayout from '../layouts/LocationLayout.astro';
import { locationsBySlug } from '../data/locations';

const location = locationsBySlug['towson'];
---

<LocationLayout 
  location={location}
  title="Personal Injury Lawyer in Towson | Alex Poberesky Law"
  description="Experienced personal injury and criminal defense attorney serving Towson, Maryland. Just 10 minutes from our office. Free consultation. Call (410) 484-0400."
>
  <h2>Experienced Legal Representation for Towson Residents</h2>
  
  <p>
    Towson, as the county seat of Baltimore County, is a thriving community home to Towson 
    University, the Towson Town Center, and numerous businesses and medical facilities. 
    Attorney Alex Poberesky provides dedicated personal injury and criminal defense 
    representation to Towson residents from our nearby Pikesville office, just 10 minutes away.
  </p>
  
  <h3>Personal Injury Cases in Towson</h3>
  
  <p>
    Towson's busy streets, including York Road, Dulaney Valley Road, and Joppa Road, see 
    heavy traffic daily. The concentration of shopping, dining, and entertainment attracts 
    visitors from throughout the region, increasing congestion and accident risks. If you've 
    been injured in Towson, you need an experienced attorney to protect your rights.
  </p>
  
  <p>We handle all types of personal injury cases in Towson, including:</p>
  
  <ul>
    <li>Car accidents on York Road, Dulaney Valley Road, and I-695</li>
    <li>Pedestrian accidents near Towson Town Center and Towson University</li>
    <li>Bicycle accidents</li>
    <li>Slip and fall accidents at businesses and restaurants</li>
    <li>Medical malpractice at Greater Baltimore Medical Center and other facilities</li>
    <li>Nursing home negligence</li>
    <li>Workplace injuries</li>
    <li>Wrongful death cases</li>
  </ul>
  
  <h3>Criminal Defense in Towson</h3>
  
  <p>
    As the location of the Baltimore County courts, Towson is where criminal cases throughout 
    the county are heard. We regularly appear in the Baltimore County Circuit Court and 
    District Court, defending clients against DUI charges, drug offenses, assault, theft, 
    and other criminal matters.
  </p>
  
  <h3>Convenient Access for Towson Clients</h3>
  
  <p>
    Our Pikesville office is just a short drive from Towson via the Beltway or Reisterstown 
    Road. We offer free consultations and flexible meeting times to accommodate your schedule. 
    With over 26 years of experience practicing in Baltimore County, we have the knowledge 
    and skill to handle your case effectively.
  </p>
  
  <h3>Serving All Towson Area Communities</h3>
  
  <p>
    In addition to Towson itself, we represent clients in nearby communities including 
    Lutherville, Timonium, Cockeysville, Hampton, Loch Raven, and Parkville. Whether you 
    live, work, or were injured in the Towson area, we're here to help with your legal needs.
  </p>
</LocationLayout>
